{
  "title": "Deleted function formatQuantity",
  "diff": [
    "diff --git a/src/lib/format.ts b/src/lib/format.ts",
    "--- a/src/lib/format.ts",
    "+++ b/src/lib/format.ts",
    "@@ -8,4 +7,0 @@ export function formatPrice(priceCents: number): string {",
    "-",
    "-export function formatQuantity(quantity: number): string {",
    "-  return quantity === 1 ? \"1 item\" : `${quantity} items`",
    "-}",
    "diff --git a/src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx b/src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx",
    "--- a/src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx",
    "+++ b/src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx",
    "@@ -2 +2 @@ import { Button } from \"@/components/ui\"",
    "-import { formatPrice, formatQuantity } from \"@/lib/format\"",
    "+import { formatPrice } from \"@/lib/format\"",
    "@@ -11 +11 @@ export function CartLine({ item }: { item: CartItem }) {",
    "-      <span>{formatQuantity(item.quantity)}</span>",
    "+      <span>{item.quantity}</span>"
  ],
  "codegraph": {
    "segments": [
      {
        "title": "Quantity wording removed from the formatters",
        "context": [
          "A line of the cart showed its quantity in words: \"1 item\" for one unit and \"3 items\" for three. A line now shows the number alone, 1 or 3. The function that wrote those words had one caller, and the change removes the function together with that call.",
          "",
          "## Overview",
          "",
          "- **When** a shopper opens the cart with 3 units of one product, **then** [the line shows `3`](code:src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx#L11), where it showed `3 items`.",
          "- **When** a line of the cart holds 1 unit, **then** [the line shows `1`](code:src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx#L11), where it showed `1 item`.",
          "- **When** a shopper reads the total of a line, the total of the cart or a price in the catalogue, **then** nothing changes.",
          "",
          "## Implementation",
          "",
          "**`src/lib/format.ts`**",
          "",
          "- Removed the function `formatQuantity()`, which returned `\"1 item\"` for a quantity of 1 and `\"3 items\"` for a quantity of 3.",
          "",
          "**`src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx`**",
          "",
          "- Removed `formatQuantity` from [the import of `@/lib/format`](code:src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx#L2).",
          "- Modified [`<CartLine />`](code:src/routes/cart/components/CartLine.tsx#CartLine) to render `item.quantity` with no call to a formatter."
        ],
        "kind": "shared",
